OL,3,AMillions casting ballots in US midterms
OL,4,Aas major poll suggests economy top
OL,5,Aissue for voters
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters across the US have named the
OL,8,Feconomy their top concern as they cast
OL,9,Fballots in the midterm elections - read
OL,10,Fthe latest from a major poll
OL,12,FAmericans are still voting across the
OL,13,FUS to determine who will control
OL,14,FCongress for the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,15,Fpresidency - when will we get results?
OL,17,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,18,Fcontrols the House and the Senate - how
OL,19,Fmany seats do the Democrats need to win
OL,20,Fto take control?
